a timer called 'job timer'.
If the 'job timer''s running then, print "a fresh timer says it is running".
Otherwise, print "a fresh timer is not running".
Start the 'job timer'.
If the 'job timer''s running then, print "after Start it is running".
Otherwise, print "after Start it is not running".
Stop the 'job timer'.
If the 'job timer''s running then, print "after Stop it is still running".
Otherwise, print "after Stop it is not running".
